  "parent": "C53.PHYSICAL_CLOSURE_HARDENING",
  "objective": "Materialize every existing iKant_LE ontological promise at the earliest honest host-consumable boundary without creating host facts, a second lifecycle, a second state writer, a second planner or a second truth owner.",
